Quiz02_01:
(FnA1szLongestMonoSubsequence)

Status: Solved With Testing


If solved, please BRIEFLY explain your strategy.

    While iterating through the sequence, I tracked the length of the current longest subsequence through
    the dp array. Additionally, the prev array allowed me to reconstruct the subsequence once the iteration was complete.
    The algorithm has O(n^2) time complexity because for each element in the sequence, I compare it with all previous elements in a nested loop, resulting in a quadratic number of comparisons.
  
