Quiz02_02: 50 points
(sort1000WithNoRecursion)

Status: Solved With Testing


If solved, please BRIEFLY explain your strategy.

    While going through the array, I used an iterative version of merge sort to sort the array without recursion. I repeatedly merged smaller parts of the array, starting with size 1 and doubling the size each time, until the entire array was sorted. During each merge, I compared and combined elements into a temporary array, which was then copied back to the original array. This method avoids recursion by using loops instead.

